{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9Db25mdWNpdXMlMjAlMjgyMDEwJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Confucius","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/rCRMOp9LvgSdpvJm1xvjFGKGfNY.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c53R0h6c4Rwb30tGbX2gNUpeJkw.jpg","description":"In 500 B.C., during Chinas famed 'Spring and Autumn Period', Kong Ze (Confucius), a commoner reverred for his outstanding wisdom, is made Minister of Law in the ancient Kingdom of Lu. Under his inspired leadership, Lu ascends to new heights but becomes a target of conquest for the warlike nation of Qi. Threatened with annihilation by their powerful neighbour, a desperate people turn to their greatest teacher to lead their most powerful army. When Confucius delivers a stunning victory against all odds, a jealous aristocracy sets out to destroy him, but they should never under-estimate a remarkable man whose wisdom is more powerful than the sword.\n\nRated PG-13 · Released 28 Jan 2010 · China · Language: Chinese · 125 min\nStudio: Beijing Film Studio\n\nOn your server — Audio: Chinese","releaseInfo":"2010","genres":["Drama","History","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.9","runtime":"125 min","cast":["Chow Yun-Fat","Zhou Xun","Wang Ban","Chen Jianbin","Ren Quan","Yao Lu","Liu Fengchao","Chen Ran"],"director":["Hu Mei"],"released":"2010-01-28T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Hu Mei","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9dTxedwXLRTVUtN0VnerWH6sDNX.jpg"},{"name":"Chow Yun-Fat","character":"Confucius","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yATfb52VXqGjQksjo9wf4WYu2pQ.jpg"},{"name":"Zhou Xun","character":"Nan Zi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gRn6nBL4LKedAZd02Zrnk3MCz7l.jpg"},{"name":"Wang Ban","character":"Shu Sunwu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y5cHczU8DGH1jjxVEPaAiiuLn0s.jpg"},{"name":"Chen Jianbin","character":"Ji Sunsi","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zG6Y1dMmSuXf2Bwe